  "status": "complete_candidate",
  "sentences": {
    "s01": {
      "id": "s01",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-text4/v3-s01.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-text4/v3-s01.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 10.15,
      "files": {
        "v3-s01.opus": "cb45aca681dfcf5672ed4da060a69886e2a0463fcc6d5ca5a6ce3e2274b44166",
        "v3-s01.mp3": "a5b072bd6cbb252db632cb9485d3ade5699e81a5dd83b475752d9580f128012d"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s01-01",
          "text": "The Supreme Court’s decisions on physician-assisted suicide carry important implications ",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 4.776
        },
        {
          "id": "s01-02",
          "text": "for how medicine seeks to relieve dying patients of pain and suffering.",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 4.776,
          "end": 10.15
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "09",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "09",
        "09"
      ],
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s02": {
      "id": "s02",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-text4/v3-s02.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-text4/v3-s02.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 21.141,
      "files": {
        "v3-s02.opus": "e8b229edb2ffc29fe46aea6a7b10f89ccd2ae175a28853cfe14b339de2eb6982",
        "v3-s02.mp3": "5f39ce3b0003b94df2c756cf9c0144d1b61720fd08b315f6559b1bf3527848a6"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s02-01",
          "text": "Although it ruled that there is no constitutional right to physician-assisted suicide, ",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 4.644
        },
        {
          "id": "s02-02",
          "text": "the Court in effect supported the medical principle of “double effect,” ",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 4.644,
          "end": 8.4
        },
        {
          "id": "s02-03",
          "text": "a centuries-old moral principle holding that an action having two effects—a good one that is intended and a harmful one that is foreseen—",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 8.4,
          "end": 17.287
        },
        {
          "id": "s02-04",
          "text": "is permissible if the actor intends only the good effect.",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 17.287,
          "end": 21.141
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "09",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "09",
        "09",
        "09",
        "09"
      ],
      "emotion": "serious",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s03": {
      "id": "s03",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-text4/v3-s03.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-text4/v3-s03.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 11.316,
      "files": {
        "v3-s03.opus": "b482ffb6b6bdf58709088b39f282b5a939e288634681f4a009e7250903ea8984",
        "v3-s03.mp3": "d603c478770851211ec98458933fd54ed6cdb9deb67581dd1192e6615bc345b1"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s03-01",
          "text": "Doctors have used that principle in recent years to justify using high doses of morphine to control terminally ill patients’ pain, ",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 7.939
        },
        {
          "id": "s03-02",
          "text": "even though increasing dosages will eventually kill the patient.",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 7.939,
          "end": 11.316
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "09",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "09",
        "09"
      ],
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s04": {
      "id": "s04",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-text4/v3-s04.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-text4/v3-s04.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 14.288,
      "files": {
        "v3-s04.opus": "83598739daea33a6bfe729eaa030a616d26bcc3911687d487898fff68177bccc",
        "v3-s04.mp3": "e3bf62851ca8b06fb0e614eb196ab59d7e4944938535ef8966aed1d4b42467f0"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s04-01",
          "text": "Nancy Dubler, director of Montefiore Medical Center, contends that the principle will shield doctors ",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 6.054
        },
        {
          "id": "s04-02",
          "text": "who “until now have very, very strongly insisted that they could not give patients sufficient medication to control their pain if that might hasten death”.",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 6.054,
          "end": 14.288
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "09",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "09",
        "09"
      ],
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s05": {
      "id": "s05",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-text4/v3-s05.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-text4/v3-s05.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 12.786,
      "files": {
        "v3-s05.opus": "193e8fd8b2d8939cd565728360baf01d9ed7711fc36d7404ddec30aa016ff168",
        "v3-s05.mp3": "51a32d784539557045ff8f5fae6b7167dfddb09512c876506b013be5cad73d9f"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s05-01",
          "text": "George Annas, chair of the health law department at Boston University, maintains that, ",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 4.757
        },
        {
          "id": "s05-02",
          "text": "as long as a doctor prescribes a drug for a legitimate medical purpose, ",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
